icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> 2nd Reach option is too powerfull - add mana cost and take away the part with keeping Blessings. Make that part 3rd reach option.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> How is it in any way too powerful?<br /> <br /> They break themselves, trying to use a few limited Supernal Mysteries and cannot even contain the Paradox.<br /> <br /> I'll add a Mana cost though, good call.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is a remedy for everything but death, a hope for everything but wickedness, and everything will lapse except righteousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6042-manusdomine","name":"ManusDomine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6042_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-05T04:33:35-07:00","id":998695,"title":"","content":"I mean to powerfull for this cost. Although with 5 mana it looks much better i still think that you should break this into more Reach options.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Many Awakened claim that Proximi Dynasties were created<br /> by ancient archmages and are tended to grow by modern mages.<br /> That may be true, but there is a growing body of evidence that<br /> suggests some Proximi lines do not have identifiable sources,<br /> and seem to have grown wild. </div> </div> </div>Keeping Blessings after the end of the spell? Ok. But using them should cost another Reach effect. Just split it into more sections. You could even make them Sleepwalker temporarily. <br /> <br /> Hmm. There is this other thing. When you gain supernatural power you automatically become Sleepwalker.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1090276-2e-moinen-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">[2E] Moinen's Homebrew Hub</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1747-moinen","name":"Moinen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"889"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}